    {
      "source": "Returns the required <a href=\"DeclaredQuery.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.query\"><code>DeclaredQuery</code></a> from a <a href=\"../Query.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository\"><code>Query</code></a> annotation or throws <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>\nif neither the annotation found nor the attribute was specified.",
      "translation": "返回由 <a href=\"DeclaredQuery.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.query\"><code>DeclaredQuery</code></a> 注解声明的所需 <a href=\"../Query.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository\"><code>Query</code></a>，或者如果未找到注解且未指定属性，则抛出 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>IllegalStateException</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"DeclaredQuery.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.query\"><code>declared count query</code></a> from a <a href=\"../Query.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.jpa.repository\"><code>Query</code></a> annotation or null if\nneither the annotation found nor the attribute was specified.",
